<td id="A1.T5.2.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Task instructions (goals &amp; constraints)</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Full intent (verbatim objective)</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T5.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row">3</th>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Refused / don’t know</td>
