<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Cost level definitions from the <span id="A1.T5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">User Simulator</span> system prompt. Cost 3 is reserved for refusal across all environments. SWE-bench, <math id="A1.T5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>-bench, and WebArena use 5 levels; TravelGym uses 3.</figcaption>
