<td id="A8.T9.2.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">.210/.800/<span id="A8.T9.2.1.3.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#70CDBE;">.778</span></td></tr>
