</section>
<section id="A11" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix K </span>LLM Usage</h2>

<div id="A11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">LLMs were used only for light editing (grammar and clarity of writing) and minor code completion (data processing scripts). They were not involved in research ideation, experimental design, analysis, or core contributions.</p>
</div>
</section>
